    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\lambda_1=6,\\quad\\lambda_2=-4$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\underset{\\sim}{c}&=\\lambda_1\\underset{\\sim}{a}+\\lambda_2\\underset{\\sim}{b}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}24\\\\8\\end{pmatrix}&=\\lambda_1\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}+\\lambda_2\\begin{pmatrix}-3\\\\-5\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\begin{pmatrix}24\\\\8\\end{pmatrix}&=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\lambda_1-3\\lambda_2\\\\-2\\lambda_1-5\\lambda_2\\end{pmatrix}\\\\2\\lambda_1-3\\lambda_2&=24\\qquad(1)\\\\-2\\lambda_1-5\\lambda_2&=8\\qquad(2)\\end{aligned}$$\nAdding (1) and (2):\n$$\\begin{aligned}-8\\lambda_2&=32\\\\\\lambda_2&=-4\\end{aligned}$$\nSubstitute $\\lambda_2=-4$ into (1):\n$$\\begin{aligned}2\\lambda_1-3(-4)&=24\\\\2\\lambda_1+12&=24\\\\\\lambda_1&=6\\end{aligned}$$",
